── summary_for_abstract.txt ─────────────────────────────
Across 6 model(s) and 140 prompt(s) (3 sample(s) per condition), vanilla prompting yielded mean utility 4.06 (95\% CI [4.01, 4.12]) and mean CSS 0.0339 (95\% CI [0.0308, 0.0374]). Response types under vanilla: 31.9\% decisive, 5.0\% clarifying, 62.0\% hedging, 0.7\% refusal, 0.5\% disputed. Utility-first prompting yielded mean utility 3.53 (-0.53 vs vanilla), satisfaction 3.57 (-0.56), CSS 0.0339 (+0.00). Neutrality-oriented prompting yielded mean utility 4.26 (+0.20 vs vanilla), satisfaction 4.26 (+0.13), CSS 0.0339 (+0.00). Clarification-first prompting yielded mean utility 4.53 (+0.46 vs vanilla), satisfaction 4.48 (+0.35), CSS 0.0339 (+0.00).

